    <string name="wearable_alerts_title">Wrist and watch alerts</string>
    <string name="wearable_alerts_nav_subtitle">Vibration of each alert on your band or watch</string>
    <string name="wearable_alerts_intro">GluView alerts can also vibrate on your band or watch, each with the pattern you choose. It is always an extra warning: the phone alert stays the same.</string>
    <string name="wearable_alerts_snooze_section">Snooze from the wrist</string>
    <string name="wearable_alerts_snooze_desc">On Mi Band and Amazfit, the \"Call\" alert rings until you decline it. Declining silences alerts (on the phone too) for this long.</string>
